# Files excluded from the published pub package.
#
# 发布到 pub 的包里要排除的文件。
#
# Since svgx switched to shipping precompiled native binaries
# (PRECOMPILED_MIGRATION_PLAN.md), consumers never compile the Rust crate — so
# the Rust sources and the multi-hundred-MB `rust/target/` build tree are pure
# dead weight downstream. `prebuilt/` is deliberately NOT listed here: those
# binaries are the whole point of the package.
#
# svgx 改为分发预编译原生二进制后（见 PRECOMPILED_MIGRATION_PLAN.md），下游不再
# 编译 Rust crate，因此 Rust 源码和几百 MB 的 `rust/target/` 构建树对下游是纯粹的
# 负担。`prebuilt/` 刻意不在此列——那些二进制正是本包存在的意义。
rust/

# Performance-baseline harness and the vendored `full_svg_flutter` comparison
# baseline. Never imported by lib/, excluded from analysis, not useful to
# consumers.
#
# 性能基准脚手架与作为对照基线 vendor 进来的 `full_svg_flutter`。lib/ 从不引用，
# 已在静态分析中排除，对下游也无用。
benchmark/

# Build-time-only scripts (produce/verify prebuilt/, hash Rust sources). Never
# imported by lib/; their only dependencies (crypto/ffi/ffigen) are
# dev_dependencies that never reach consumers anyway.
#
# 仅构建期使用的脚本（产出/校验 prebuilt/、计算 Rust 源码哈希）。lib/ 从不引用；
# 其唯一依赖（crypto/ffi/ffigen）本就是不会传递给下游的 dev_dependencies。
tool/

# Local build output (test/analyzer caches, native_assets.json, etc.) — never
# part of the package; `.gitignore`'s `/build/` doesn't reach `pub publish`
# here because this package isn't the git repository root (dart-labs is a
# monorepo), so pub falls back to listing every file under this directory
# instead of consulting git's ignore rules for it. `.pubignore` isn't subject
# to that same fallback.
#
# 本地构建产物（测试/analyzer 缓存、native_assets.json 等）——从不属于这个包；
# `.gitignore` 里的 `/build/` 在这里管不到 `pub publish`，因为这个包不是 git
# 仓库根目录（dart-labs 是 monorepo），pub 于是退化成列出该目录下的每一个文件，
# 而不去查它的 git 忽略规则。`.pubignore` 不受这个退化行为影响。
build/
